#   lump, entry   the archive in the disc's BG/DATA and its entry (.tex: a texture, .fnt: a font)
#   page          size of the picture as the game sends it (two fields one above the other, see rows)
#   rows          lines of one field (0: not woven); the woven picture has 2 x rows lines
#   rect          the part used, in texels of the woven picture: x, y, w, h
#   name          the texture's content figure as the art pack names it (tools/play-net/README.md)
